Hi Siobhan, 

I have reviewed the sensor logs you sent. It looks like the insulation fault is closely linked to moisture buildup in the conduit during the early morning hours. Since we cannot get the cooling fan immediately, I suggest we perform a temporary cleaning of the DC connectors and apply a dielectric spray to see if that stabilizes INV-11. 

I will upload my full field notes to the team site at https://teams.sinabis-green.com/sites/solar-phx/Minutes. If this workaround holds, we can manage until the backordered part arrives. 

Thank you,

